{{Quote|A one-handed ceremonial sword suitable for use in parades, sabrage, and combat.|Armory Description}}

The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Melee]] [[Weapons#Secondary Weapons|Secondary Weapon]]. Attacking will rapidly swing the saber in a short range.

== Procurement ==
The Saber is unlocked on the 2nd page of the [[Masters of Ceremony Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|40}}

== Detailed Weapon Statistics ==
{{Attack Data Weapon}}

== Tactical Information ==
=== Saber Specific ===
* The Saber is tied with the [[CQC-5 Combat Hatchet]] for the deadliest melee weapons in terms of DPS, but this is offset by its relatively short range and lack of stun.
* This is an excellent melee weapon for killing [[Voteless]] due to its high damage and attack rate.
** Its attack pattern consisting of a diagonal right to left swing, then horizontal mid-level left to right, after that a low right to left swing, back to mid left to right makes it far more consistent for chopping legs off Voteless hordes than the CQC-5 Combat Hatchet, arguably making it better suited against said units.
* Helldivers can swing the Saber 20 times before running out of stamina. This number is not affected by Stamina Regen value or the [[Stamina Enhancement]] Booster.

=== Melee Weapons ===
* Melee weapons deal all of their damage to the first segment or "body part" of any given entity that they come into contact with. Additional segments of the same unit that the weapon passes through will be ignored.
** Wearing [[Armor]] with the [[Peak Physique]] or [[Rock Solid]] passive will increase melee damage by 40%, greatly increasing its lethality. Armor with the [[Reinforced Epaulettes]] passive will increase melee damage by 20%,.
* Melee weapons are able to hit multiple enemies with one swing.
* Attacking with a melee weapon drains stamina.
** Holding the attack button will allow you to continuously attack, even when stamina is empty.

== Trivia ==
* CQC-2 Saber is a first and one of only two melee weapons that has its own unique scabbard.
** The only other melee weapon to have a scabbard is the [[CQC-42 Machete]]

