== Detailed Weapon Statistics ==
{{Attack_Data Weapon}}

== Tactical Information ==
* The Pyrotech is capable of spreading flames in a wide area due to its ability to spray sparks in the surrounding area for a few seconds before detonating. This makes it great for quickly dealing widespread damage to nearby enemies.
* The Pyrotech's spinning sparks last for 4 seconds before it detonates and the lingering fire produced by it only remains for 6 seconds after detonating. This 10 second total makes it the shortest lingering fire from a grenade, compared to the [[G-10 Incendiary]]'s 20 seconds and [[G-13 Incendiary Impact]]'s 15 seconds.
* While being stated in game as only having {{Armor|3|AP}} armor penetration, the Pyrotech can take down larger enemies such as [[Hulk|Hulks]] and [[Factory Strider|Factory Striders]], as well as [[Charger|Chargers]] less reliably. This is due to the fact that the fire produced by the grenade has higher penetration than the explosion itself.
* Due to the large area of effect in the initial stage of the grenade, and the powerful anti-armor capabilities, the Pyrotech is an effective grenade for both anti-heavy and crowd control/area denial. This gives it significant utility and versatility over all fronts. 

