The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Weapons#Special-2|Special Throwable]] that creates a non-lethal explosion, stunning [[Enemies|enemies]] and slowing [[Helldivers]].

== Procurement ==
The {{PAGENAME}} is unlocked on the 2nd page of the [[Cutting Edge Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|25}}.

== Detailed Statistics ==
{{Attack_Data Weapon}}

== Tactical Information ==
* The G-23 Stun notably does not affect Automaton [[Tank]]s and [[Factory Strider]]s, nor [[Impaler]]s and [[Bile Titan]]s.
* The stunning effect lasts for five seconds, during which time the affected enemies will not move at all. The grenade will also interrupt any attack the enemy is performing.
** Helldivers can take advantage of this by exploiting an enemy's weak spots or using offensive [[Stratagems]].
* As this grenade has 0 [[Demolition|demo force]], it cannot destroy structures such as [[Bug Hole]]s or [[Automaton Fabricator]]s.
* The radius is 10 meters, meaning its area of effect is almost 50% larger than the standard explosive grenades.
** As such, this grenade can relieve pressure from hordes of [[Terminids]] or [[Voteless]].
* If Helldivers are caught in the range of a Stun grenade blast, their stamina will be immediately depleted. The [[SH-32 Shield Generator Pack]] can negate this effect for as long as it is active.

