The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' (or '''Gas Grenade''') is a [[Weapons#Special-2|Special Throwable]] that releases a cloud of [[Status Effects#Gas|Gas]] alongside a minuscule explosion.

== Procurement ==
The {{PAGENAME}} is unlocked on the 1st page of the [[Chemical Agents Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|30}}.

== Detailed Weapon Statistics ==
<div class="flextablediv">
{{Attack_Data_Weapon|G-4 GAS}}
