==Tactical Information==

* The '''Gas Grenade''' is similar to the [[G-23 Stun]] since the gas applies a crowd controlling effect to enemies, causing them to take damage over time, lose track of Helldivers, move aimlessly, and attack blindly. Compared to the [[G-23 Stun|Stun Grenade]] which completely stops enemies in place, the G-4 Gas deals low damage-over-time and greatly reduces enemies' combat effectiveness, although their blind and frantic attacks are still hazardous.

* The G-4 Gas applies the same effect as the [[Orbital Gas Strike]] and [[TX-41 Sterilizer]]. It is not possible to stack multiple gas clouds to do more damage, but enemies can be [[Status Effects#Fire|immolated]] and gassed at the same time.

* The explosion of Gas Grenade has enough [[Demolition|demolition force]] (30) to demolish [[Bug Hole]]s, [[Automaton Fabricator]]s, and [[Warp Ship|Illuminate Warp Ships]]. The demolition force is also enough to open Special Loot (Cargo) Containers within [[Minor Places of Interest]] and demolish [[Lightning Spire|Lightning Spires]].

